  "releaseNotes": "'## [9.11.7](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/compare/v9.11.6...v9.11.7) (2025-10-15)\n\n### Bug Fixes\n\n* transpilation of `k8s.Models.ResourceQuantity` ([#959](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/959)) ([8b4350c](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/8b4350c40807a2c98b59b99d03f5daf3af798f8e))\n\n### Dependencies\n\n* **ci:** update actions/setup-node action to v6 ([#970](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/970)) ([e363711](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/e363711d17555606b569664ee44fe787eb3132fb))\n* **core:** update dependency system.commandline to 2.0.0-rc.2.25502.107 ([#968](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/968)) ([86be1ab](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/86be1abf69d0d15d636eba3f907aa5d583e23f21))\n* **test:** update dotnet monorepo to 9.0.10 ([#969](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/969)) ([5f0e560](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/5f0e560e1023fbddba2f07f11b906041f22abc56))\n'",
